# Directory Structure brane worker node

A Brane worker requires a specific directory hierarchy to manage secrets, certificates, and runtime state. Create this structure in your home directory:

```Plaintext
~/brane-central/
├── config/
│   ├── certs/            # Contains ca.pem, server.pem, client-id.pem
│   ├── secrets/          # Contains policy_secret.pem
│   └── node.yml          # Worker configuration
├── target/
│   └── release/          # Contains worker-instance-x86_64.tar.gz
└── policies.db           # Local policy database
```

